				<r3d:remarks>CPUT figshare uses altmetric.com to track the impact of the publications and research data.
CPUT Libraries support researchers with secured spaces for research data where authors can store, share and discover research data using  eSango (CPUT Data Repositories) Figshare (https://cput.figshare.com/) and MediaTum (http://rdm.cput.ac.za/) This makes it easy for research data  to be viewed, accessible and cited.  Share, save and publish research output in these open access data repositories. The Institutional Repository (http://digitalknowledge.cput.ac.za/) allow researchers to share their research output in the University&#039;s open access institutional repository.</r3d:remarks>
